  "notes": [
   "This certificate is awarded on completion of the Certificate of Achievement in Child Development Teacher (73 units: the core and support courses plus 24 units of general education) and CHLD 90B, CHLD 90C and CHLD 86A. The Core Courses and Support Courses blocks are taken from the shared 'Core and Support Courses' list, which the Teacher certificate incorporates by reference.",
   "'Units: 85' includes the 24 GE units, so it is recorded as degree_total, not total_units. No total without GE is printed.",
   "CHLD 86A appears both in Core Courses and in this certificate's own list. CHLD 90B and CHLD 90C appear both in the Support Courses list and in this certificate's own list. The catalog's 85 = 73 + 12 appears to count CHLD 86A twice; a reviewer should check this.",
   "Support course units are not printed in the shared list. Units for CHLD 50D, 80A, 80B and 80C appear in other certificate sections (5, 2, 2, 1).",
   "Program Learning Outcomes are printed once for the Child Development program as a whole; this award shares them.",
   "The catalog prints codes without leading zeros (CHLD 51A, ANTH 2A, ANTH 2AH) where the closed list uses CHLD 051A, ANTH 002A and ANTH 02AH; these were treated as the same courses.",
